<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Intimate Brands said cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Intimate Brands said cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities cut its rating on Intimate Brands Inc to hold from buy, a source at the brokerage said.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares were down 3/8 at 18-3/4.</p>
</text>
